\n\nDescription:\nInspired Kitchens & Baths presents magnificent kitchens and luxurious bathrooms from more than 70 leading international design professionals. Stretching from coast to coast, the collection curated within these pages shows off a wide range of layouts in a variety of styles. Arranged in two chapters with nearly 800 photos and separated by contemporary, transitional, and traditional design, this book features everything from grand, tech-savvy kitchens to highly styled galley varieties. You'll also enjoy the range of bathrooms from spa- inspired primary bathrooms to imaginative powder rooms-each one as impressive as the next. All portray smart design stemming from a great imagination with a keen sense of harmony. function, style, and form. Whether you simply enjoy dreaming or you are actively seeking ideas and resources for your own home of the future, the homes, materials, and techniques included in this special collection are sure to exceed expectations. Get to know these experts and a sense of their style, how they work, their perspectives, and the creative Imagination they bring to the drawing board. And when you are ready to move forward, consider taking them on your journey. During your journey through the book, you will notice QR codes that will open up videos and other content for even deeper intermedia dives into the projects and professionals featured within. Simply click the QR code to unlock this additional content. For our print book readers, scanning the code with your smart phone or tablet will open up this content right on your device. If you like what you see and read, feel free to share this book via email or social media by clicking the social media icon in the upper left toolbar. This book is available in bookstores and on Amazon in the Summer of 2024-or visit any of the professionals showcased herein. Turn the pages and enjoy!\n\nEvaluate whether this book satisfies the user's search intent.\n\nReturn:\n\n* score (0, 1, or 2)\n* concise reason\n", 'role': 'user'}], 'model': 'gpt-4o-mini', 'response_format': {'type': 'json_schema', 'json_schema': {'schema': {'description': 'Structured relevance judgment for a single (query, book) pair.\n\nThe ``reason`` field is mandatory so every judgment can be audited\nor used for fine-tuning the judge model later.', 'properties': {'score': {'description': 'Relevance score: 0 = not relevant, 1 = somewhat relevant, 2 = highly relevant.', 'title': 'Score', 'type': 'integer'}, 'reason': {'description': 'Concise explanation (1-3 sentences) justifying the score. Used for auditing and debugging.', 'title': 'Reason', 'type': 'string'}}, 'required': ['score', 'reason'], 'title': 'RelevanceScore', 'type': 'object', 'additionalProperties': False}, 'name': 'RelevanceScore', 'strict': True}}, 'stream': False, 'temperature': 0.0}}
