s a Birthday\n\nDescription:\nSpend storytime traipsing through the Hundred Acre Wood with Winnie-the-Pooh and friends! In this cozy board book, Piglet and Pooh do their best to celebrate Eeyore\'s birthday, with questionable results. Humor and delight mark this story of friendship and only the best intentions. This little book is a wonderful window into the classic characters created by A.A. Milne, and the perfect gift for babies and toddlers discovering the world of Winnie-the-Pooh. Perfect for bedtime stories, read-aloud moments, or first independent "reading" experiences, this board book helps young children build early literacy skills while enjoying familiar tales. Parents and grandparents will love sharing this treasured story, making it a meaningful gift for birthdays, baby showers, or holidays. A.A. Milne\'s classic Winnie-the-Pooh stories distilled into stories for babies and toddlers. Reading familiar stories provides a foundation for learning and comprehension through kindergarten. The charming artwork of Eeyore and his friends makes this heartfelt story a pleasure to read again and again. Sturdy, thick board pages designed to withstand traditional wear and tear on board books for curious little infants and toddlers. This timeless tale inspires kindness, teaches problem-solving, and is perfectly paced to hold a child\'s attention.\n\nEvaluate whether this book satisfies the user\'s search intent.\n\nReturn:\n\n* score (0, 1, or 2)\n* concise reason\n', 'role': 'user'}], 'model': 'gpt-4o-mini', 'response_format': {'type': 'json_schema', 'json_schema': {'schema': {'description': 'Structured relevance judgment for a single (query, book) pair.\n\nThe ``reason`` field is mandatory so every judgment can be audited\nor used for fine-tuning the judge model later.', 'properties': {'score': {'description': 'Relevance score: 0 = not relevant, 1 = somewhat relevant, 2 = highly relevant.', 'title': 'Score', 'type': 'integer'}, 'reason': {'description': 'Concise explan