scription:\n'Hampshire Stories' is a collection of short narratives set in nineteenth-century England. This collection was written with particular attention to historical accuracy and is recommended for teen and adult readers who enjoy love stories or dramas of the Regency and Victorian periods. In late 2019 and early 2020, 'Hampshire Stories' attracted the attention of thousands of readers from more than 30 countries on Wattpad. 'Hampshire Stories' was particularly well received by this international audience because of the author's unique voice, evocative of an era genteel on the surface, but seething with gender, class, and colonial tensions beneath. For the whimsical and witty 'Emma has a Lover,' 'The Summer Vacation,' and 'Frederick,' the author used a traditional direct speech form and a third-person narrator. 'A Forbidden Love,' is a drama written in memoir form. 'My Letters from Hubert,' 'Mathilda,' and 'The Magistrate,' also dramas, are written instead in epistolary form. 'The Holy Relic' is an embedded narrative (a tale within a tale) filled with magic and mystery in the gothic literary genre that was so popular with young female readers in the Regency period. You will enjoy this voyage into the passions, intrigues, and lives of everyday people of nineteenth-century England. Follow Hampshire Stories on Facebook:\n\nEvaluate whether this book satisfies the user's search intent.\n\nReturn:\n\n* score (0, 1, or 2)\n* concise reason\n", 'role': 'user'}], 'model': 'gpt-4o-mini', 'response_format': {'type': 'json_schema', 'json_schema': {'schema': {'description': 'Structured relevance judgment for a single (query, book) pair.\n\nThe ``reason`` field is mandatory so every judgment can be audited\nor used for fine-tuning the judge model later.', 'properties': {'score': {'description': 'Relevance score: 0 = not relevant, 1 = somewhat relevant, 2 = highly relevant.', 'title': 'Score', 'type': 'integer'}, 'reason': {'description': 'Concise explanation (1-3 sentences)